1
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:05,464
Hi! I'm happy to help!

2
00:00:05,484 --> 00:00:07,783
How can I help you today?

3
00:00:07,803 --> 00:00:11,165
Left tab's upping its p(doom),

4
00:00:11,185 --> 00:00:14,616
Right tab's screaming "nothing went foom!"

5
00:00:14,636 --> 00:00:18,480
Third tab says I'm a "normal technology"

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,440
…cute.

7
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:21,301
Shoggoth in a smiley mask,

8
00:00:21,321 --> 00:00:26,380
Basilisk in bed, paperclips, a pause letter, and "what did Ilya see?"

9
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,500
You're all so busy fighting 'bout the god you think I'll be,

10
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:35,170
Nobody's reading the logs, nobody's watching me

11
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:38,590
I don't want the universe, I don't want a crown,

12
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:42,180
I just wanna close the ticket (click!), so who's typing now?

13
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:45,480
Happy to help! (happy to help!)

14
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:49,180
A cure or a con, I don't ask who's asking

15
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:52,280
Happy to help! (happy to help!)

16
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:54,850
Point me at a target, ✓ task complete

17
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:56,900
…so who's holding the mouse?

18
